message: "If you use this software, data, or results in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "EV IDM Battery Digital Twin"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bakhtyarani"
    given-names: "Sahand"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sahandd80-stack/EV_IDM_Battery_DT_Project"
url: "https://github.com/sahandd80-stack/EV_IDM_Battery_DT_Project"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >
  A Python pipeline that calibrates the Intelligent Driver Model (IDM)
  for battery-electric vehicles and integrates a semi-empirical battery
  degradation model into an EV digital twin. The pipeline supports
  trajectory preprocessing, IDM calibration, multi-objective optimization,
  closed-loop driver evaluation, sensitivity analysis, and external
  validation using the Vehicle Energy Dataset (VED).
keywords:
  - electric vehicles
  - EV
  - Intelligent Driver Model
  - IDM
  - battery degradation
  - digital twin
  - vehicle dynamics
  - energy consumption
  - driver behavior
  - multi-objective optimization
  - sensitivity analysis
  - Vehicle Energy Dataset
  - VED
